title: RIP phase-4 proof — a blackout with no thresholds declared
description: The same hung service and the same load, but the experiment declares no thresholds. A window nobody answered is recorded in the journal and is not a deviation by itself, with oha as with k6.

tags[2]: proof, performance
kind: performance
target:
  system: checkout-blackout
  technology: http
  environment: demo

load:
  tool: oha
  script: http://127.0.0.1:44381/
  vus: 2
  duration_s: 2

method[1]:
  - name: hold-briefly
    activity_type: action
    provider:
      type: process
      path: sh
      arguments[2]: "-c", "sleep 1"
      timeout_s: 5.0

rollbacks[0]:
